OL,5,G0155 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FTwo grooms-to-be come to the
OL,7,     Fclinic with lumps they want to get
OL,8,     Frid of before their big days: Carl
OL,9,     Fhas multiple lipomas, while Alan
OL,10,     Fneeds a neck cyst removed.
OL,11,G0245 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,12,     FEmma comes in complaining of
OL,13,     Fchronic pain in her spine and leg,
OL,14,     FColin has a sore scrotum and is
OL,15,     Fworried he's found a lump, and
OL,16,     Fgravedigger Neil's hernia is
OL,17,     Fcausing him discomfort.
